stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle: Non shared
  Consenting: Popup visible
  Active: Shared tab
  Revoked: Permission revoked

  Idle --> Consenting: user opens share UI
  Consenting --> Active: user clicks share
  Consenting --> Idle: popup closed
  Active --> Revoked: target identity changed
  Active --> Revoked: tab closed
  Active --> Revoked: user revoke
  Active --> Revoked: gateway revoke
  Revoked --> Idle: permission removed
